WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
That's bad.

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.160
This attack came the very same month

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.480
that Charlie Kirk was assassinated

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.760
by a far-left extremist who inscribed the words,

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.920
hey fascist, catch, meaning catch the bullet.

